 r←Test_HooksOnRequestFnError dummy;router;req;result
 ⍝ An error in OnRequestFn is handled like a handler error, and OnResponseFn still runs
 router←#.Mocks.NewHookRouter
 router.OnRequestFn←'BrokenOnRequest'
 router.OnErrorFn←'HandleError'
 req←⎕NEW #.Mocks.MockRequest ('GET' '/items')
 result←router._Dispatch req
 r←(500=req.Response.Status)∧('deliberate OnRequestFn error'≡result.message)∧(500=(⊃#.Mocks.Log).status)
